A '''Sundial''' is an {{Epic}} item.

== Usage ==
A '''Sundial''' can be given to {{NPCSprite|Sam}} to permanently unlock {{Green|Crop Speed}} settings in [[The Garden#The Desk|The Desk]], which allows the player to change their maximum {{Stat|spd}} while harvesting individual crops.

