== Trivia ==
* Upon gifting a '''Sundial''' to {{NPCSprite|Sam}}, a physical Sundial appears in [[The Garden]] near the player's barn. Interacting with it displays the following message: {{Dialogue|
&7&oThe sundial reads <nowiki><time></nowiki>.
}}
* Breaking tall grass in a garden plot will trigger the set speed cap for [[Sunflower]]s/[[Moonflower]]s. This likely happens because they all share the same base block id in older versions of Minecraft, that being <code>double_plant</code>.

